{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学！”“给我过来瓜生！”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁／纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "go052", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早安……安洁，今天没有站在校门啊。”", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种事情现在无所谓了！”", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0466", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生，你跟爱理什么都没有是真的吗！？”", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0176", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "视线越过两人的肩膀望向教室内。", "text_idx": 551, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……爱理满脸通红地低着头。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学坚持说上星期的新吾同学只是身体不舒服而已。”", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0467", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是旁人看起来明明就是有问题，说什么事都没有根本在骗人！”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0177", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是说，先到学校的爱理，在我出现前的这段时间已经被质问一番了……", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她应该很努力转移话题，但现在一脸因为疲惫和羞耻而快死掉的表情。", "text_idx": 549, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁以为两位一定是在心意相通的过程中。”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0468", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是爱理对你好像已经变成称呼名字了。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0178", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学，真的跟爱理同学什么事都没发生吗！？”", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0469", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我偷瞄了爱理一眼。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说是！我还没做好心理准备”。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的眼神在对我这么说。", "text_idx": 536, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……了解了解。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，当然啦。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再自然不过地回答。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "幸好，这种控制表情的技巧我比爱理擅长许多。", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该说正因为爱理那个模样，我的态度必须更坚定才行。", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错没错没错！”爱理在远处连连点头。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，就照这样……", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟爱理是朋友。”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“朋友……！！！”", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1978", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……此时，爱理突然僵住了。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0179", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“朋友……”", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1979", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虚软……", "text_idx": 548, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱、爱理同学？”", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0470", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我去洗手间……”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1980", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "全员", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "go053", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她垂下肩膀，脚步虚浮地走掉了。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "该不会……被我说的“朋友”打击到了？", "text_idx": 552, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“各位同学，早安啊……”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "mc0127", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天也麻烦各位了。好……咦？濑、濑名同学呢？”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "mc0128", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理直到班会开始都没有回来。", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明、明明是她自己说要保密的……！", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说、说的也是，抱歉，你说的没错！”", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1981", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第１节课后的下课时间。", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班会结束后爱理就回来了。而现在我把她拉到教室角落确认现状。", "text_idx": 538, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再、再尝试一次。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1982", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……老实说出来比较好吧？”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行！太羞耻了！”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1983", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理大步地走向安洁她们。", "text_idx": 533, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好吧，爱理都这样说了，我就配合她……", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，小爱理他们回来了。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0266", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们在教室角落讨论的时候，隼太也来到学校了，天羽学姐跟樱乃也来了。", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“上星期，因为你们两人相处得很不好，我有点在意──”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0267", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“大家听我说！”", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "“大家听我说！”", "plain_idx": 425, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1984", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理切换成宣告模式。", "text_idx": 531, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都安静下来看着她。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……应该说，整个班级的人都在注视她。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要、要说什么事都没有的后续是吗？”", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0472", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错！”", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1985", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听好了，我跟新吾，什么事都没发生。”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1986", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "sk0556", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "唯一知道我们实际状况的樱乃瞄了我一眼。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能苦笑回应。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很像在说谎欸～”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0181", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“变得直呼名字了呢。但是，并不是关系更进一步吗？”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0268", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或者说固定下来的关系……”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0473", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当、当然了！”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1987", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然脸红得很明显，但仍拼命坚持的爱理。", "text_idx": 550, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她是真的非常不想让大家知道。", "text_idx": 539, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾他，只是……”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1988", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只是……”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1989", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1990", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只、只是？”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0474", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只是……朋、朋友……”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1991", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1992", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "才说完，她的眼眶就蓄满了泪水……", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋！说不出口啦！因为喜欢新吾喜欢到没有办法了啊……！！”", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1993", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，毫无掩饰地在大家面前公开了──", "text_idx": 543, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这样，星期五开始我们就交往了。”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“开始交往了……”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1994", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休时，固定成员们聚在一起，我向他们报告了我们的事情。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的～为什么不立刻说出来呢爱理同学～”", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0476", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉……”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1995", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为太羞耻了……！”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1996", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟男人交往的肤浅的自己吗？”", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0183", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是的。一旦注意到自己的心意后，我就喜欢新吾喜欢到无法克制……”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1997", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经不同了，跟以前不同了。我不知道在大家面前该摆出什么态度才好。”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1998", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，真的很抱歉。但是我非常……唔唔唔唔～！”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar1999", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一边道歉，爱理一边因为羞耻而整个人缩了起来。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是恋爱中的少女……！”", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0184", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……那个爱理同学变得如此可爱……！”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0477", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的……好想要紧紧抱住她喔……”", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0270", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然我已经知道了。”", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "sk0558", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉女生们因为爱理的模样而兴奋不已。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……♪”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0221", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而唯一的男生伙伴则是连连点头微笑，手臂搭上我的肩膀。", "text_idx": 546, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯……我说，那个啊……”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0222", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该怎么样就怎么样的感觉。”", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0223", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太……”", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，婚礼的演讲就交给我吧。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0224", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想太远了吧！”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什、别、别这样别这样椋梨君……！”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2000", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，你们没有那个打算？”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0225", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种重要的事情，要两个人仔细思考……”", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2001", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊啊爱理同学有那个打算～♪”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0478", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊够了不要再调侃我了啦安洁──”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2002", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然晚了点，不过恭喜你们。真的是太好了。”", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0479", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2003", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，真的太好了。小爱理跟瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0271", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，我一直都觉得你们很相配喔。”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 544, "voice": "mu0272", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理居然跟男人交往了啊……”", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0185", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，好吧，虽然不能理解，但既然发生了就要幸福喔！”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈，总之祝你们幸福啦！”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 553, "voice": "ht0226", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "sk0559", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……唔……”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2004", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "收到大家的祝福──", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;“谢谢……”", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "“谢谢……”", "plain_idx": 470, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2005", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊呀啊，爱理同学又更害羞了♪”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0480", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理把自己缩得更小了。", "text_idx": 535, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生！要是敢对爱理不好我就杀了你喔！”", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 542, "voice": "sn0187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“正是如此！之后就麻烦你了，就算为了自己的性命着想！”", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "ag0481", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而我则受到生命威胁了。", "text_idx": 547, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好羞耻、好羞耻！在做好心理准备前就被大家……”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2006", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事没事，这也是没办法的。”", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔……早知道会这样，一开始就老实说出来还比较好……！”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2007", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，我也是这么想。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔唔～～！”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2008", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理回到家后也还是害羞个不停。", "text_idx": 532, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她抱住我的手臂，红透的脸颊压在上面蹭来蹭去。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，大家都很可爱呢。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以才更觉得羞耻了啊……！至今为止没有被朋友说过那种话嘛。”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2009", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像他们早就想说了……”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的祝福让我有这种感觉。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他们似乎早就想看到，总是把自己绷得紧紧的爱理松懈下来的样子。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾也是？”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2010", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是不是，爱理也知道吧？”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2011", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是但是，那是因为是新吾啊。跟大家完全不同……”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2012", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是先开启这个话题的人是爱理啊……", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，这个爱哭撒娇鬼爱理不管谁来看都会觉得可爱吧。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……谈恋爱，好辛苦呢。”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2014", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理小声地说，脸颊还贴在我的手臂上。", "text_idx": 534, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是只有交往的两个人自己的事呢……”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2015", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……的确呢。”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且在我们交往前，也受到大家很多照顾。", "text_idx": 545, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，现在却觉得“这样也没关系”……恋爱很辛苦，而且不可思议。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理。”", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我低下头，温柔地喊她。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2016", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我喜欢你。”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯咕……”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2017", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "抱紧……", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理使力抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还、还要。”", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2018", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喜欢爱理。”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2019", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我喜欢爱理喔。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 522, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反复说着。", "text_idx": 513, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2020", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理也不停点头，然后越来越用力抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 529, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与最喜欢的人相处的时光。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "会让人身体无法克制地发热……", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也……是喔。只有你……”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "ar2021", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想拥抱、亲吻这个微笑。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过忍耐已经不像以前一样辛苦了，只有对未知的行为的惊慌，以及莫名的甜蜜搔痒。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 165, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以现在只是让她抱着手臂。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 166, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道只要慢慢地爬上阶梯，总有一天会跟这女孩……", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 167, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──结果这之后，直到冷静下来为止，爱理都没有放开我。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
